  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About&#x3a; Reconciles one IMPS settlement cycle across four feeds (NPCI clearing, Base24 switch,&#xd;&#xa;Finacle CBS, RTGS GL pool), joined on RRN with NPCI as the driving side. Each txn is&#xd;&#xa;classified as Matched STP or a break (RC91 timeout, missing leg, amount mismatch,&#xd;&#xa;deemed failure, cycle or status mismatch).&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Params&#x3a; Input folder, cycle ID, output folder (defaults to this project folder).&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Output&#x3a; Matched_Records_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx and Unmatched_Records_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx, both attached to the&#xd;&#xa;workflow result for download. Complete on success, Diverted when there is no data.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Errors&#x3a; Malformed input rows go down the error hop to the error log and end with Failure.</note>
